The '''Mahogany Seed''' is a seed that grows into a [[Mahogany Tree]]. It can be obtained by shaking or chopping down a [[Mahogany Tree]], using an [[Axes|Axe]] or [[Pickaxes|Pickaxe]] to dig up a Mahogany Seed dropped by a fully grown [[Mahogany Tree]] on [[The Farm]], chopping a [[Large Stump]] or a [[Large Log]], inside of a [[Golden Coconut]], or killing [[Slimes]] in the [[Secret Woods]].

Mahogany Seeds can also be purchased from the [[Island Trader]] for 1 [[Stingray]], or from the [[Giant Stump#Raccoon Wife's Shop|Raccoon Wife's Shop]] for 20 [[Coal]] after completing four requests.

Mahogany Seeds fertilized with [[Tree Fertilizer]] have a 60% chance of growing to the next stage each night. Unfertilized seeds have a 15% chance of growing to the next stage.

