==Tailoring==
Mahogany Seed is used in the spool of the [[2 Willow Lane#Sewing Machine|Sewing Machine]] to create the {{Name|Beanie|class=inline}}. It can be used in [[dyeing]], serving as an orange dye at the dye pots, located in [[Emily]] and [[Haley]]'s house, [[2 Willow Lane]].

